<p>Automation is the new standard by which products are presented on TikTok. Using the intelligent product tagging inside the videos that TikTok's AI-powered recommendation tools provide, manufacturers might become more noticeable and the engagement rate higher. They track every viewer's click, behavior, and preferences and automatically provide recommended products during the playback, thus increasing the chance for conversion. One of the merits of this technique is that it enables an algorithm to automatically place a business's products in front of the relevant audience from whom they might be interested.</p>
