<p>Another critical feature of automation is the ability to optimize inventory management. The newest inventory management technologies can use sales history data to calculate the stock levels and leave the reordering task to these systems. By adopting such a process as a proactive measure, those popular items will not be out of stock, which is the cause of missing out on sales. Besides that, it is a valuable tool that allows warehouse space to be managed more efficiently by identifying unused items on shelves and decreasing stock levels.</p>
